== Match report ==

=== Zong 1–1 Kaneda ===
[[Kaneda national football team|Kaneda]] struck first in [[Castejón]], but [[Zong national football team|Zong]] responded late to salvage a point in a tight Group A contest.

=== Mercia 0–1 Kalisongo ===
[[Kalisongo national football team|Kalisongo]] grabbed a narrow win against [[Mercia national football team|Mercia]] in [[Macaio]], with a second-half goal proving decisive.

=== Hersatia 2–0 Dagit ===
[[Hersatia national football team|Hersatia]] controlled the game in [[Yerba Buena]] and converted their superiority into a comfortable two-goal victory over [[Dagit national football team|Dagit]].

=== Galwa 3–0 Tamazgha ===
[[Galwa national football team|Galwa]] delivered the most emphatic result of the day in [[Martapura]], scoring early and adding two more after the break to beat [[Tamazgha national football team|Tamazgha]].

=== Bayan 2–2 Sanyan ===
[[Bayan national football team|Bayan]] and [[Sanyan national football team|Sanyan]] shared a lively draw in [[Axarquía]], with both teams finding the net twice in an open match.

=== Tondano 4–0 Nakamizu ===
[[Tondano national football team|Tondano]] delivered the performance of the matchday in [[Concepción]], routing [[Nakamizu national football team|Nakamizu]] 4–0. [[Stefan Sumual]] opened the scoring in just the 2nd minute, pouncing on a loose ball after Nakamizu lost possession from the kick-off. Tondano controlled the rest of the first half but couldn't find a second, going into the break 1–0 up.

The floodgates opened after the break. [[Gavin Rondonuwu]] doubled the lead in the 52nd minute, and just five minutes later [[Nico Mangindaan]] made it 3–0 with a quick-fire double that effectively ended the contest. Nakamizu offered little in response, managing only a handful of half-chances. [[Michael Luntungan]] capped off the rout with a 90th-minute goal to seal a comprehensive 4–0 victory and confirm Tondano as Group F winners on goal difference.

== Summary ==

Matchday 5 produced 11 goals, highlighted by [[Tondano national football team|Tondano]]'s 4–0 win over [[Nakamizu national football team|Nakamizu]] and [[Galwa national football team|Galwa]]'s 3–0 victory over [[Tamazgha national football team|Tamazgha]]. [[Hersatia national football team|Hersatia]] and [[Kalisongo national football team|Kalisongo]] also secured important wins, while [[Zong national football team|Zong]] and [[Bayan national football team|Bayan]] shared the points.

